  "description": {
   "en": "The streaming guild that Goshu belonged to fired him and posted a video humiliating him to boost their followers. Disgraced, Goshu takes refuge in a small village where he starts streaming videos about farming. However, his peaceful life drastically changes when a dragon appears in the area. Goshu easily defeats the creature, but the incident is recorded and goes viral, causing a huge stir among his viewers.",
   "ja": "所属していたギルドから、あらぬ疑いを掛けられ追放されたゴーシュ。一人細々と農耕動画の配信中、危険度A級のドラゴンが出現！配信を切り忘れたまま軽々とドラゴンを討伐した。「つまらないものを見せてしまった…」と反省するも視聴者は大騒ぎ！！"
  },
